  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_1328acea-59f1-4a0e-a216-6743e66be8c9.png\" alt=\"Watt About Power? by Tr3yMix\" width=\"850\" height=\"283\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_2ae9178d-cd85-4b68-aa36-5317c1d4e361.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_c20746bf-4e97-4635-b4c8-56e32ae2fd9a.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_4d0ba42a-9008-41e4-a22a-72d6b0d16970.png\" alt=\"NeoForge\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>前置模組</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_9c999190-1b30-4ab8-bb3f-37979f849154.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_d8dba763-5746-4b59-ac79-f614dc3b1082.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_6241c1c3-131c-474a-ae1f-34b2b1c176b9.png\" alt=\"Architectury API\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p>✨ <strong>關於此模組</strong> ✨</p><p>你是否曾經想要按個開關，就能讓你的Minecraft家園活起來——而且不用餵飽你那耗資源的發電機？有了這個為MrCrayfish的新家具模組「Furniture Refurbished」設計的附加模組，現在你可以辦到了！⚡</p><p>此模組新增了一個名為斷路器的方塊。這個精巧的小方塊是你家電力系統的新心臟，能直接從你最喜歡的科技模組（如Mekanism、Tech Reborn和Create: Crafts and Additions）汲取電力。再也不需要用那些能用來合成火把或點燃營火的煤炭來餵發電機——只要簡單、可持續的能源，就能讓你的燈泡持續發光、吊扇持續轉動。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_46ddc807-aaad-4342-bb90-ab6143075cb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_3047e4e7-129f-4f3f-874c-bc834dcc5fa7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">*已於Mekanism、Tech Reborn、Integrated Dynamics和Create Crafts & Additions上測試。<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_700d7ff5-1383-4695-bb82-582298b9a06d.png\" alt=\"Mekanism\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/techreborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_a0daf121-03bc-4cc9-afac-9da1f774db83.png\" alt=\"Tech Reborn\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/createaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_a5079aaf-127e-4c58-9420-905fdbc3a336.png\" alt=\"Create Crafts & Additions\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-dynamics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170251/description_bc03d42d-7d35-485f-af4c-0794803952ee.png\" alt=\"integrated dynamics\" width=\"230\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>原版模組及其內容的完整功勞歸屬於MrCrayfish。感謝你的出色作品！</p>",
